<title>USA: Leslie's Poolmart approves buyout.</title>
<headline>Leslie's Poolmart approves buyout.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leslie's Poolmart said its board approved the management buyout that will take the company private.</p>
<p>The transaction is being led by Hancock Park Associates and Leonard Green &amp; Partners.</p>
<p>The company said that certain members of the board of directors will retain a portion of their stockholdings in the surviving company &quot;although a substantial amount of their shares will be acquired in the transaction along with, and at the same price as, all other outstanding shares.&quot;</p>
<p>Completion of the transaction is subject to the satisfaction of a number of conditions, including approval by company shareholders, completion of financing and compliance with regulatory requirements.</p>
</text>
